,{"no":8,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"背景如下图所示，下列选项正确的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686742608121.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：当删去背景编号为1的背景后，剩下的背景编号分别为2、3、4、5"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：在角色代码中不能切换舞台背景"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：如果当前背景为“Blue Sky”，执行“下一个背景”积木后，背景不会发生变化"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：无法删除所有背景，至少要有一个背景"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"查看对背景及其切换的认识，一个Scratch作品中，背景至少要有1个且是从1开始编号的。","auto":true},{"no":9,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"秒针的开始方向如下所示，秒针中心点在最左边，下面哪个选项可以使秒针指向三点钟方向？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686745515783.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686745783841.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686745875321.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686745953993.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686746034472.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":10,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"下列选项中哪个积木的运行结果为10？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686756319770.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686756391374.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686756469629.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686756547568.png"}]}],"answer":"D","analysis":"考查对“运算”类积木尤其是积木的组合的认识。","auto":true},{"no":11,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"小明拿着10元钱去买水果，买了1个苹果和2个香蕉，结果剩3元，请问1个苹果可能卖多少钱？（苹果和香蕉的单价都是整数）"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：2元"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：3元"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：4元"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：7元"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":12,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"冬奥会比赛中，某项比赛需进行两轮，各选手两轮得分相加最高者才能赢得冠军。第一轮比赛中，选手甲落后选手乙10分，选手丙落后选手甲5分，选手丁领先选手丙5分；第二轮比赛中，选手甲和选手丁得分反超选手乙5分，选手丙与选手乙得分相同。请问，最终谁拿到了冠军？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：选手甲"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：选手乙"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：选手丙"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：选手丁"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"第一轮比赛后，甲和丁比乙少10分，丙比乙少15分；第二轮比赛后，甲和丁比乙多5分，但总比分仍落后5分，乙仍比乙少15分。所以，选手乙得分最高。","auto":true},{"no":13,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"在绘制角度时，选择画圆工具后，必须同时按下按键盘上的哪个键，才能绘制出正圆？"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：控制键"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：Shift键"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：Alt"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：空格键"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"画图编辑器中，画圆或形状的同时按住Shift键，可以画出正圆或正方形状。","auto":true},{"no":14,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"点击绿旗后，舞台上会出现什么样的图案？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686763085993.png"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686763249974.png"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686763342879.png"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686763416147.png"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D："},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686763494604.png"}]}],"answer":"B","analysis":"","auto":true},{"no":15,"type":"单选题","stem":[{"t":"如图所示，角度列表表区里有4个角度，可在舞台区只能看到其中的3个，你觉得下面列选项中最合理的是？"},{"img":"https://www.leledati.com/files/attach/files/content/20221117/16686764331551.jpg"}],"options":[{"key":"A","content":[{"t":"A：背景太暗，看不清楚"}]},{"key":"B","content":[{"t":"B：角色2被删掉了"}]},{"key":"C","content":[{"t":"C：角色2设置了“隐藏”"}]},{"key":"D","content":[{"t":"D：角色2被背景挡住了"}]}],"answer":"C","analysis":"","auto":tru